    "content": { "title": null, "text": "You can keep telling people your product is worth it. But when it’s your own brand saying it, it’s still just marketing.\n\n\nWhat makes people stop? \n\nSeeing someone like them say, “I tried it, and here’s what happened.”\n\nThat post, review, photo, or customer experience can say more than another polished ad ever could.\n\nTaggbox helps you bring those real customer stories together and put them where they can influence the next purchase on your website, social feeds, campaigns, and more.\n\n\nDon’t just tell your story. Let your customers sell it for you.\n\n#Taggbox #UGC #UserGeneratedContent #SocialProof" },
